{"id":"W1014488a1adbe3ea8c88f187","zh":"权重组合","en":"","name":"权重组合","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":"按赋定权重组合参数或分析结果的方法。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W1014488a1adbe3ea8c88f187","text":"权重组合","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sa3031d976a07bf09e1aa","source_id":"P117","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"本文主要运用上述分层设计与权重组合方法实现车辆-轨道系统的横向低动力作用的参数匹配。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S3449cc3d084e066f926d","source_id":"P117","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"若以其他动力指标为优化目标,其最优范围又将有所不同,此时需要采用式(3)进行参数的权重组合计算。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S2f1dcf617a09cd121ab0","source_id":"P137","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"从表4可见:参数最优匹配结果因车速和权重组合不同而不同;当车速为80 km/h时,不同权重系数下的最优参数组合呈现出非常大的差异,两类权重系数下的计权总分都不高;当主要考虑隧道壁减振时,最高得分仅为70.86分,说明当车速为80 km/h时,系统的参数选择很难兼顾所有的指标,需根据实际需求进行取舍。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S31b4034f25e47fe323ca","source_id":"P137","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"以车速160 km/h为例,以乘坐舒适性为权重组合原则的最终总得分在29~78分之间;对于得分前5 名的工况,板厚均为250 mm、板下垂向刚度均为 0.03 N/mm3,有5个工况扣件刚度为70 kN/mm。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":7,"page_end":7}]}],"sources":{"P117":{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"},"P137":{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"协调不同设计层及不同动力指标对应的参数结果。","language":"zh","source_id":"P117","paper_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"分配四类响应指标在总评分中的比重，表达减振或舒适性优先需求。","language":"zh","source_id":"P137","paper_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wd724eb70181ba793b28c62eb","name":"weight combination","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wd724eb70181ba793b28c62eb","name":"weight combination","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wd724eb70181ba793b28c62eb","name":"weight combination","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"},{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}]}